+## Phase 5: User Story 3 - Fail clearly, and leave nothing half-made (Priority: P3)
+
+**Goal**: Every rejection names exactly what was refused and why, writes no archive at all, leaves
+any pre-existing archive untouched, and leaves no temporary file anywhere. There is never a
+truncated archive to mistake for a good one.
+
+**Independent Test**: run `create` against a non-existent path, against a tree containing a
+symbolic link, and against a tree exceeding the resource bounds, confirming each time that exit
+status is 2, the message names the offending path or member, and no file appears at the archive
+path.
+
